				This is usually caused by NVIDIA G-Sync.

Fix: NVIDIA Control Panel → Manage 3D settings → Program Settings → Add the game’s .exe → set Monitor Technology to Fixed Refresh → Apply. G-Sync stays on for your other games.

Alternatively, play in Windowed mode (Settings → Video).

Still black, or no Monitor Technology option? Let us know your GPU and monitor model....			&lt;/div&gt;
			&lt;div class=&quot;topic_hover_row&quot;&gt;
